== the audit job also calls verify
file: .gitlab-ci.yml
message: job conformance:audit runs vibe audit and also calls the verify command `task verify`
fix: run vibe audit in a job of its own that does not call verify

== verify in the audit job's before_script
file: .gitlab-ci.yml
message: job conformance:audit runs vibe audit and also calls the verify command `task verify`
fix: run vibe audit in a job of its own that does not call verify

== verify in the audit job's after_script does not count
no findings

== vibe audit in after_script does not count
file: .gitlab-ci.yml
message: no job that runs in merge request pipelines runs vibe audit (workflow:rules, rules: or only/except that leave the pipeline out, changes: or exists:, and conditions the audit does not read make a job not count)
fix: add a job that runs in merge request pipelines, whose script runs vibe audit (any arguments) and that calls no verify command

