== the default branch only
file: .gitlab-ci.yml
message: line 9: job conformance:audit does not count for merge request pipelines: rules: no rule admits it
fix: make the job run in merge request pipelines with conditions the audit reads ($CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE, $CI_MERGE_REQUEST_IID, $CI_COMMIT_BRANCH, $CI_COMMIT_TAG, $CI_COMMIT_REF_NAME, $CI_DEFAULT_BRANCH), without changes: or exists:

